Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:01:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(37.2,142.4)}{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs15\b0\bord0\shad0\3c&H2F2F2F&\c&HB7B5B7&\fad(0,500)}{\K60}弹道导弹核潜艇"野兽"\N{\K66}{\K38}深海营救任务
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看声纳  有什么发现\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look at the sonar. Let me know what you find.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前没什么变动  情况越来越糟了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So far nothing new, my friend. It just keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪安吉洛  马克斯  回话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}D'Angelo, Marks, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们移动到了声纳舱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We've moved to the sonar room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前只救出了九名人员\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just nine rescues so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况很糟  是我见过最糟的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's a mess, man. This is the worst I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁来救救我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命  有人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Help! Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又发现一名幸存者\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I got one more survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正返回深潜救生艇\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Heading back to the rescue vehicle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-马克斯  -迪安吉洛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Marks. - D'Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  潜艇外面有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, that's something outside the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There's something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You okay, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有东西在撞击船体  快回深潜救生艇\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Something's crushing the hull. Get back to the rescue vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-立刻  -我们马上跟上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Now. - We're right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙用力拉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You guys, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接到了  推过去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Got him. Slide him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克斯  迪安吉洛  汇报情况\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Marks. D'Angelo. Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You almost here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:55.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  听着  我们困住了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, listen to me. We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:56.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰撞造成舱口被堵\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The impact jammed the hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.04,0:02:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回去找你们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜水艇开始崩塌了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The sub is starting to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-马克斯  -乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Marks! - Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快下来  不然就太迟了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We need you down here before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜水艇严重损毁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The sub's been breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水漫得到处都是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There's water everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  声纳室里都是水\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, the room is flooding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克斯  我们得打开舱口\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Marks, we gotta get this hatch open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  乔纳斯  你人呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, Jonas. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-没用的  -救我们出去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- It's not gonna work! - Let us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-快点  求求你  -我们需要时间\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Hurry, please! - We just need more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我们回个话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let us know when you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别放弃\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  求你了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点下来  你在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come down here, now! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You've lost your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开  海勒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Back off, Heller.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们回去  所有人都得死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If we go back, everyone dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都干了些什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(41.6,170.666)\clip(38.8,163.733,52,251.733)\t(29,655,\clip(35.2,166.933,139.2,250.667))}{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs14\b0\2a&HFF&\bord0\shad1.5\3c&H2F2F2F&\c&HB7B5B7&\fad(0,500)\4c&H000000&}中国上海
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(41.6,227.199)\clip(38.8,163.733,45.6,252.8)\t(64,655,\clip(40,208.533,126,251.733))}{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs14\b0\2a&HFF&\bord0\shad1.5\3c&H2F2F2F&\c&HB7B5B7&\fad(0,500)\4c&H000000&}五年后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(34.8,42.666)\clip(29.2,34.133,42.8,89.067)\t(25,734,\clip(29.2,34.133,205.6,85.867))}{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs14\b0\2a&HFF&\bord0\shad1.5\3c&H2F2F2F&\c&HB7B5B7&\fad(0,500)\4c&H000000&}距离中国海岸200英里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(34.8,97.599)\clip(34,76.267,47.6,128.533)\t(23,607,\clip(34,76.267,235.2,125.867))}{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs14\b0\2a&HFF&\bord0\shad1.5\3c&H2F2F2F&\c&HB7B5B7&\fad(0,500)\4c&H000000&}"神力一号"科研站
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在做梦还是怎么的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are we living the dream here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到神力一号  莫里斯先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Welcome to Mana One, Mr. Morris.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手给我拿开\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Get that thing away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来抱一个  这就对了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, bring it in. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-很高兴再次见到你  莫里斯先生  -我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Good to see you again, Mr. Morris. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你闻起来总是很香  用了什么  檀香吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, you always smell so nice. What is that? Sandalwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前看到的就已经很了不起了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's impressive so far, I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, here they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得我女儿苏茵吗  \N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Do you remember my daughter Suyin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:05:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我们的首席海洋生物学家\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Our chief marine biologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}很高兴见到脑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}他的口音好奇怪呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  她说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sorry, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没听懂\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I didn't catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说她喜欢你的帽子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She says she likes your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-对  -对\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Oh, yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-走吧  -那走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Let's go. - Why don't we go? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的外孙女是个小机灵鬼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your granddaughter's a pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是什么地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有点...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This is, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太难看了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Really ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这里还在建造中\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know, I realize that we're under construction and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:48.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我真的觉得世界一流的研究机构\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but I really think that a world-class research institute
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须配上世界级的大门\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}deserves a world-class entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再同意不过了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, I couldn't agree more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,0层到了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}O-Level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到0层\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Welcome to the O-Level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的中控台\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This is our central hub
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦完工后\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}from which researchers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会有五个实验室可供研究者使用\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}will access all five labs once it's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不是每天都能见到的景象\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's not something you see every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你让鲸鱼们路过这里的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Did you have those whales here on cue?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用了点鲸鱼的"歌曲"来吸引它们过来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I might have lured them with some whale songs.
