Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里斯先生  你来得正好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mr. Morris, just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说我还要继续听\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So I keep hearing.
