Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来得正好要做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just in time for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好  莫里斯先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Good morning, Mr. Morris.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗莉·泰勒  我们的执潜驾驶员\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Lori Taylor, our mission pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:27.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  莫里斯先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hi, Mr. Morris.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你前来  是我们的荣幸\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Welcome on board. It's good to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面情况怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How's it going down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.64,0:08:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪里学到驾驶潜水艇的本事的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Where'd you learn how to pilot a sub?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在一个拯救鲸鱼的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I spent 10 years with a certain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,环保组织工作了十年\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}whale-saving environmental group
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为法律问题而不便透露名字\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that shall remain unnamed for legal reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  问问她有没有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, ask her if she ever
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用自制鱼雷炸翻过一搜捕鲸船\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}blew up a whaling ship with a homemade torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-别瞎说  -不是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Hey. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你挑人的眼光不错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That is a good hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两分钟后到达11度\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Eleven in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水温六摄氏度\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Water temperature is at six degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  我们正在通过温跃层\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac, we are through the thermocline.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正接近11000米深度\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We are approaching 11,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离海地约100米\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}One hundred meters from the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe from the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"也许"  为什么说是也许\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}"Maybe"? What does he mean, "Maybe"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来  看看这个\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自1875年以来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Since 1875
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都相信\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we've all believed the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马里亚纳海沟是地球上最深的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mariana Trench was the deepest place on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一个理论  我们认为海洋的底部\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I've had a theory that what we think is the bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际上可能是一层硫化氢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}might actually be a layer of hydrogen sulfide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那片气雾和冰冷的温跃层下面\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Beneath that cloud, and a freezing cold thermocline
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能有一个全新的世界\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}there could be a completely new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:29.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起源号很快就能证实我父亲的理论\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The Origin is about to see if my father is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果下面有暖水\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If there is warm water below,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:34.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就是第一个看到它的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that means we're going to be the first to see it.
