Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在开玩笑  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He's kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十米  接近边界\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ten meters. Approaching boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悬停于五米处  已停止\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hovering at five meters. Full stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终检测\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Final checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-杰克斯  -正常\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Jaxx? - Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-医生  -船员体质正常\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Doc? - Crew are go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-DJ  -潜艇与探测器正常\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- DJ? - Sub and rover are go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起源号船员\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Origin crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以插入\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we are go for insertion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,插入\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Insertion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你们来说什么都可以扭曲成黄笑话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is everything sexual with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:15.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,性  食物  力量还有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sex, food, power and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来击个拳\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Blow it up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜水控制中心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Dive control,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以插入\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we are a go for insertion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  我们进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You guys, we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是气雾  没到海底\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's a cloud. It is not the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗莉  小心点  我们不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Lori, be careful. We don't know the depth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面有多深\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}on the other side of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海底在你们的头顶上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The sea floor could come right up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到  马克  我们准备好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Copy that, Mac. We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  我们进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You guys, we are through!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我收到了多个声纳反馈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I have multiple small sonar contacts.
