Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光源已部属  我去转转\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Lights deployed. I'm gonna come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:13.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  告诉我你收到了画面\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac, tell me you're getting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都看到了  罗莉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We're getting all of it, Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Got a lot of smiling faces up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,DJ  这个地形可以发射探测器\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}DJ, we got positive terrain to launch the rover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以发射\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Launch is all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探测器\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Rover is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已释放\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水温低于三摄氏度\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Water temperature below three degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个生态系统被冰冷的温跃层\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This ecosystem is completely cut off
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与其他海洋完全隔绝了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}from the rest of the ocean by the freezing cold thermocline.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该能找到\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We should find all sorts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不为科学所知的各种物种\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}of species completely unknown to science.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来是个不错的投资\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sounds like a good investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.28,0:13:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗莉  我收到了一个声纳反馈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Lori, I have a contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方位080\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Bearing zero eight zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很大\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Huh. It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常大\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, it's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且它移动得很快\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And it's moving fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,DJ  探测器有视野吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}DJ, is the rover seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  我试试再打开点光源\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Negative. Let me try and bring up some more lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探测器一号  信号收到干扰\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Rover One, signal interrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遥感信号丢失了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Whoa, I just lost telemetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起源号  立即右转到305方位\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Origin, recommend an immediate right turn to three-five-zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:55.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能只是岩块崩塌\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This could be a landslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我印象中  岩块可不会90度大转弯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Last time I checked, landslides don't make 90-degree turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.24,0:14:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它朝我们来了  朝我们直冲过来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's right on us! It's right on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:16.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这见鬼的是什么东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗莉  下面发生了什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Lori, what's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-怎么了  -看看这个\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- What? - Come look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么东西能把探测器撞成这样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What could do that to the rover?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't think I wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它又回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快走  炸掉沉浮箱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's get out of here. Blow the tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在试  没用\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm trying. It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-开不起来  -马克  快帮帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- It's not starting! - Mac, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-整个系统都瘫痪了  -天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Whole system's down! - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪  DJ  马克  下面有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, my God. DJ, Mac. There's something down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯是对的  你们收...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas was right! Do you co...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗莉  回话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Lori, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起源号  能收到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Origin, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:14:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起源号  请回话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Origin, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-快啊  -罗莉  回话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Come on. - Lori, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华尔  能听到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wall, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿俊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Toshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各部门集中一下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Gather around, people. Options.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不妙  -我们知道他们还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Not great. - We know they're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能遥测到他们的生命体征\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I've still got telemetry on their vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还剩下多少时间\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How long do they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概18个小时\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe 18 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压载阀卡住了  意味着它不能自行升起\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ballast valves are jammed, which means it can't rise by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们试图拖走它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If we attempt to tow it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有50%的几率\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}it's fifty-fifty that the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沉浮箱会爆炸  破坏船体\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}tanks will explode, and breach the capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不能对接舱口吗  -不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Can't we go hatch-to-hatch? - Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外置摄像头显示舱口严重损坏\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The external camera's showing severe hatch damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须试一试\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We have to try something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在万米深的海底\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They're six miles down and no
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人在这样的深度里展开过营救\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}one has ever attempted a rescue at that depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不完全正确\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, that's not exactly true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不可能的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做得到的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在11000米的深度  你们做不到的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Not at 11,000 meters, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在5000米  8000米都成功过\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We've gone 5,000 meters, 8,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术到位  深度其实只是一个数字罢了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}At some point, it just becomes a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:56.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不试试这个深度\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Why don't you try this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:15:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在万米以下的海底\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's how many people have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,执行过营救行动的人数\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}actually attempted a rescue below 10,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And the number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是活着回来的人数\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's how many are left alive to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人  乔纳斯·泰勒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}One man. Jonas Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看那个人上一次\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And look what happened to that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去到这个深度时都做了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}one man the last time he went to these depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他救出了11个人  包括你  海勒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He saved 11 people including you, Heller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这就是他做的  -他丢下我们的朋友等死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- That's what happened. - He left our friends to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他得了气压性精神病\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}because he had pressure-induced psychosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  海勒  那是你自己诊断的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, Heller. That was your diagnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯说有东西袭击了他们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas said something attacked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大到能够撞毁一艘核潜艇\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Something big enough to take out a nuclear submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-他是个酒鬼  -你没听明白我在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- He's a drunk. - You're not listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正在泰国的海滩上醉成一滩烂泥  \N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He's washed up on a beach in Thailand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没在听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're not listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你听到罗莉说什么了  -我在听  我听到了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Did you hear what Lori said? - I'm listening. I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你当时在现场吗  -够了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Were you there? - That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都听到了罗莉在最后一次传输中说了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We all heard Lori's last transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须考虑这种可能性  起源号也许\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We have to consider that Origin may have encountered
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到了乔纳斯·泰勒描述的那种生物\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}something similar to what Jonas Taylor described.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.32,0:16:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有能力逃离的那种生物\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Something he was able to escape from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  别这样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ba! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备直升机\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Prep the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去泰国\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We must go to Thailand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(194.4,171.199)\clip(190.4,165.867,202.8,213.333)\t(22,1023,\clip(190.4,165.867,342.8,210.133))}{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs14\b0\2a&HFF&\bord0\shad1.5\3c&H2F2F2F&\c&HB7B5B7&\fad(0,200)\4c&H000000&}泰国  北榄府
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的船要弄死我了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your boat, she's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一引擎掉出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Number one engine slips out of the gear
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,液压装置里面还漏水了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and there's some leak in the hydraulics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今晚检查一下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, I'll take a look at it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你昨晚  昨晚的前一晚  前晚的再前一晚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's what you said last night and the night before that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是这么说的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and the night before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我会弄好的  -你喝太多了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Hey, I'm working up to it. - You drink too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, now you're only saying that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是因为我现在正好拿着啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}because I literally have a beer in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你啤酒从来不离手\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You always have beer in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我喝太多了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Because I drink too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下变成了一个多事的周二夜晚了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now this is shaping up to be an eventful Tuesday evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我喜欢不请自来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know I like to make an entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:22.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼的  马克  五年过去了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hell, Mac, after five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.69,0:18:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出现在我面前就叫不请自来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}just showing up is making an entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你住在酒吧楼上  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What? You're living above a bar? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你才会登门啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Figured it was the only way to get you to come visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  容我为你引见...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, allow me to introduce...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很荣幸见到你  张博士\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's an honor to meet you, Dr. Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直很佩服您的研究\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Always had a tremendous respect for your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太客气了  泰勒先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're too kind, Mr. Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的  你是个好人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, no, I'm not. You're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我请你们俩喝啤酒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, can I offer either of you two a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我要来一瓶\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}'Cause I'm gonna have a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是来做客的  乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's not a social call, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说你们不是特意搭直升机来做客的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You mean you didn't helicopter in just to say hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很受伤  马克\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You wound me, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们遇到了一个严重的...  -麻烦吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- We have a serious... - Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:18:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,料到了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如你所知\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just like you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不搞潜水了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't dive anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我受够了对别人负责  马克  -泰勒先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Done being responsible for people, Mac. - Mr. Taylor...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.40,0:19:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无意冒犯  张先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, I mean no offense, Dr. Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:09.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是说这个星球上有谁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I mean, if there was two people on this planet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我重返水中\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that could get me back into the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许就是你们俩了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}it's probably you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们说不动我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们告诉我麻烦是什么 然后我就会拒绝\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're gonna tell me your problem and I'll say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你们会说给我钱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're gonna offer me money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是会拒绝\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'll still say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你们想唤起我的良知\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're gonna appeal to my better nature
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而我还是会拒绝\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and I'm gonna say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我没有良知\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Because I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要我说  我们何不坐下来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So I say, why don't we sit down,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好喝几杯啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we'll enjoy a couple of beers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后送你们回去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and then we can get you on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.36,0:19:36.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是今早发生的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This happened this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:42.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快走  炸掉沉浮箱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's get out of here. Blow the tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在试  没用\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm trying. It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-开不起来  -马克  快帮帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- It's not starting! - Mac, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-整个系统都瘫痪了  -天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Whole system's down! - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪  DJ  马克  下面有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, my God. DJ, Mac. There's something down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.76,0:19:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯是对的  你们收...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas was right! Do you co...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是罗莉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的前妻和她的团队困在了11000米深的海底\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your ex-wife and her crew are trapped below 11,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.48,0:20:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕他们可能\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I fear they may have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到了你之前遇到的物种\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}encountered the same species you did down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有比你欠缺经验的潜水员愿意前去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I have divers with less experience willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我觉得必须让我的团队\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But I feel I owe it to my crew
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,获得最高的被营救成功几率\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}to give this rescue the best chance of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗莉  把六角扳手给我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Lori, hand me that hexa key.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.12,0:20:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们把防火墙弄短路\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If we can short out the firewall,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也许就能重启电脑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I can probably reboot the computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 快试试\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay. Try it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.36,0:20:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辅助动力重新启动了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Auxiliary power's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:20:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加热器也启动了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Heaters are online.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎不可能启动得了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There's no way that we'll get the engine started,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们也许可以启动重新压载舱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but we might be able to get the ballast tanks back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么  记笔记吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What are you doing? Taking notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.36,0:21:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我妻子留封信\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Letter to my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能弄好的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:17.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一步步来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Step by step.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  击个章鱼拳\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on. Give me that fighting octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都有用\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Works every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:42.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-怎么了  -我们得把灯关掉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- What? - We gotta can the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把灯关掉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Turn out the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.60,0:22:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面有别的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There was something down there with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的船舱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How can you be sure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有观测窗  你怎么能肯定这一点\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}if there were no observation windows on your craft?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.36,0:22:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为不管那是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}'Cause whatever it was
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,核潜艇的整个右舷都崩塌了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}caved in the entire starboard side of a nuclear submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是我想象出来的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That wasn't my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才在营救途中炸毁了舱口\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is that why you blew the hatch mid-rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我把11个人完好无损地救了回来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, look, I brought 11 men back safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但因为你慌了  你扔下8个人在那等死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You left eight more to die because you panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我不炸掉舱口\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If I hadn't blown the hatch,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们全都会被那生物杀了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we all would have been killed by that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.16,0:22:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就没有什么生物  \N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There was no thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有任何证据能证明它的存在\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There was no evidence of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.84,0:22:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为它被爆炸摧毁了  海勒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Because it was destroyed in the explosion, Heller.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时千钧一发\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look, there was no time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我做了决定\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So I made the call!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你的怯懦  你留我们的朋友在那等死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And you left our friends there to die in an act of cowardice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得那下面发生了什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What do you think happened down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他崩溃了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而现在我们又要把他送去面对同样的情境\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And now we're about to send him into the exact same situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.80,0:22:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  苏茵\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Excuse me, Suyin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰下  我们需要你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm sorry to interrupt you, but we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有紧急情况\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.68,0:23:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  杰克斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What's wrong, Jaxx?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的氧气在泄漏\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now they're leaking oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.68,0:23:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们只有几个小时能撑了  最多多一点\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They've got a couple of hours. Maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.76,0:23:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我去  -不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I'm going. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-等等  什么  -我开水下滑翔器走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Wait, what? - I'll take one of the gliders,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.36,0:23:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把起源号拖上来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}grab the Origin and tow her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  要是起源号的压载舱爆炸了  \N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wait! If the Origin's ballast tanks blow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.14,0:23:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也会丧命的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}you're gonna die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须试一试\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.68,0:23:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅英\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}你在这儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}我们有些朋友在海底下被困在那里了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}妈妈要下去救他们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}为什么  我能和你一起去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}等你长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.65,0:23:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}妈妈知道你是妈妈最勇敢的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.53,0:23:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.83,0:23:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}妈妈爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.87,0:24:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.56,0:24:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通讯测试\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Communications check!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.40,0:24:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以发射\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  可以发射了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, you are go for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理查德·伯德\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Richard Byrd.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.36,0:24:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动自动下降序列\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Auto descent sequence initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.68,0:24:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好啊  梅英  -你好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Hey, Meiying. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-长官  我们又有麻烦了  -是你女儿\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Sir, we've got a new problem. - It's your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她开了一架水下滑翔器去救他们了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She took a glider to try and save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要让她去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Why did you let her go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.68,0:25:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我  不是我让她去的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Trust me, I didn't let her do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.96,0:25:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点觉得你应该\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I was sort of under the impression you're supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.52,0:25:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去拯救困在海底的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}try to save people who are dying on the bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.84,0:25:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这人是谁  -为这一切买单的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Who's he? - I'm the guy who paid for all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.88,0:25:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看起来很英勇  步伐很快\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know, he looks heroic and he walks fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.96,0:25:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他的态度有点消极\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but he's kind of got a negative attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.88,0:25:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-还有多少时间  -很少\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- What's the window? - It'll be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.84,0:25:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.36,0:25:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这里的设计师\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm the one that designed all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.48,0:25:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说我的命在你手上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So my life's in your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.28,0:25:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多吧  有问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Pretty much. That a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.28,0:26:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来胸有成竹\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You look like you might actually know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜水控制层\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Dive control level.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  让海勒医生到医疗舱见我们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac, have Dr. Heller meet us in the medical bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.60,0:26:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海勒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Heller?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.68,0:26:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没提到他也在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Did I not mention that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.88,0:26:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操你妈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.32,0:26:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他身体状况很好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He's in perfect shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.80,0:26:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像你上次检查的一样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just like the last time you examined me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.64,0:26:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵15分钟前开水下滑翔器走了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin took a glider 15 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.24,0:26:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她打算把起源号拉上来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She's planning on taking the Origin back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.52,0:26:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-带我去潜艇  -还没检查完\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Take me to the sub. - We're not done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,检查完了  罗莉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, we are. Lori's running
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要没氧气了  而且我们现在在公海\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}out of air and we're in international waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说我可以揍到你妈都不认得你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}which means legally I can beat the ever-loving shit out of you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.28,0:26:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不犯法\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.44,0:26:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从法律上来说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Legally, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.48,0:26:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好在他没有怀恨在心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Good thing he doesn't hold a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.32,0:26:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  你知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, you do know that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.44,0:26:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这艘潜艇的设计最深只达12000米吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}this sub is rated for 12,000 meters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.64,0:26:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像在海底漏气的那艘吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Like the one leaking on the ocean floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.60,0:26:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怼得好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ah. Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.84,0:26:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好了吗  -好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- We good? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:26:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦你脱离安全装置\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Once you strip back the safeties
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.96,0:27:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全手动操控  我知道你肯定会这么做的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and go full manual, like I know you're gonna do,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统为了跟上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}the system's gonna have problems
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.40,0:27:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海底压强变化  就会出现问题\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}trying to keep up with your pressure changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.88,0:27:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让压强把你耳朵弄炸了  兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Try not to blow your ears out, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了  兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thanks, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  船长\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hello, skipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.84,0:27:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定就是那个疯子了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You must be the crazy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.64,0:27:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-谁叫我疯子  -我妈妈  还有海勒博士\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Now who called me that? - My mom. Dr. Heller.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.44,0:27:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我不是疯子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, well, I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.96,0:27:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是看到了别人没看到的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I've just seen things no one else has.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.52,0:27:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就叫疯子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's the definition of crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.76,0:27:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,备用动力  备用动力...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Backup power. Backup power...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父母在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈去海底\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My mom's trying to bring our friends back
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.24,0:27:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我们的朋友了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}from the bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.64,0:28:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸在台北和一个普拉提教练在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My dad's with a Pilates instructor in Taipei.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.48,0:28:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外公说妈妈得往前看\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Granddad says Mom needs to move on,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.36,0:28:07.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是妈妈说她需要时间\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but Mom says she needs more time
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.17,0:28:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她嫁了一个混蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}because she was married to an a-hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉你妈妈说得很有道理\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sounds like your mom's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂得挺多\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.96,0:28:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八岁小孩无所不知\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Eight-year-olds hear everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来试试吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mind if I give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.12,0:28:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.88,0:28:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疯子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.60,0:28:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈会死吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is my mom gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开泡泡船长过去  你妈妈马上就回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'll have Captain Bubbles and your mom back in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.76,0:28:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.00,0:28:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  艾玛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you, Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化号倒数15秒发射\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Evolution launch in T-minus 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.40,0:28:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-DJ  -可以\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- DJ? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.72,0:28:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克斯  可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jaxx, we good?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.96,0:28:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.40,0:28:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化号\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Evolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.88,0:29:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备下潜\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we are go for dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.40,0:29:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.48,0:29:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统准备下降\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}System go for descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.52,0:29:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统准备下降\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}System go for descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.52,0:29:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.60,0:29:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以发射了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.12,0:29:25.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统准备下降\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}System go for descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.88,0:29:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统准备下降\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}System go for descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.32,0:29:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.64,0:29:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系统准备下降\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}System go for descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.84,0:29:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化号发射成功\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Evolution successful launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.72,0:29:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化号正通过1000米深度\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Evolution now passing 1,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.76,0:30:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告  进化号二级系统离线\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Caution. Evolution secondary systems offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.28,0:30:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是怎么下潜如此之快的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How is he descending so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在切断所有不必要的输出\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Looks like he's diverted all nonessential power,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:13.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是供热和生命维持设备  以供动力输出\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}like heat and life support, to the motors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.40,0:30:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会晕过去的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He's gonna black out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.12,0:30:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的血液含氧量在下降\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}His blood gases are dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.68,0:30:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.08,0:30:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉海勒我不会降速的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Tell Heller I'm not slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.08,0:30:37.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  请注意  进化号正前往\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, be advised. Evolution is now en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.52,0:30:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请立即返回神力一号\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Request you return to Mana One immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.68,0:30:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他可以护送我们回去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Negative. He can give us an escort on our way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:43.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫她别碍事  马克\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Tell her to get out of the way, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.40,0:30:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多个人就多份风险  她头脑发热了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}More people means more risk and she's in way over her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.32,0:30:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  你说的她都听到了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, you just told her yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.32,0:30:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对讲机上的绿色按钮\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The little green button on your intercom,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.96,0:30:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个才是用来单通道对话的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that's for single channel communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:30:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.88,0:31:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入温跃层\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Entering thermocline.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.64,0:31:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  马克  我进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay, Mac. I am through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告  压力负荷接近16000PSI\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Warning. Pressure load approaching 16,000 PSI.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.72,0:31:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个速度下  我必须切断取暖器\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}At this speed, I'm gonna have to divert power from the heaters
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.04,0:31:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和所有可能结冰的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and shut down anything that could ice over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.40,0:31:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到另一边再打给你们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Call you from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.28,0:31:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这里有无线吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You got Wi-Fi here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.16,0:31:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用力压住\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just keep pressure on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.64,0:31:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-阿俊  它还在外面吗  -我说不准\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Toshi, is it still out there? - I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.60,0:31:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在什么都看不见\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I can't see anything right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.20,0:32:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.16,0:32:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现起源号\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I've got visual on the Origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.60,0:32:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起源号船体基本完好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I can see most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.28,0:32:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  他们还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay. They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.08,0:32:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备拖船\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm going to set up to tow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.08,0:32:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标距离  六米  四米\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Range to target, six meters. Four meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.16,0:32:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标锁定\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Target locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.48,0:32:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射磁性尺钩\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Firing magnetic hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.60,0:32:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三  二...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Three, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.04,0:33:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  你还好吗  发生什么事了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin? Are you okay? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.04,0:33:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底下有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There is something down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.84,0:33:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有东西撞了我的船\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Something just hit my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.80,0:33:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-苏茵  怎么回事  -是一只巨大的鱿鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Suyin, what's happening? - It's a huge squid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.88,0:33:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它绞住了滑翔器\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's got the glider.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压力警报\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Warning. Capsule pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.64,0:33:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  它在挤压我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac, it's crushing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.56,0:33:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在挤压我的船  我觉得滑翔器支撑不住了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's crushing me! I don't think the glider can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.48,0:33:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,支撑不住的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's not gonna hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.52,0:33:46.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  打开压力补偿器\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, engage the pressure compensator.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.40,0:33:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压力补偿器打开不了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Compensator will not engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.12,0:33:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船体将在10秒内坍塌\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Capsule breach in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.76,0:33:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船体将在5秒内坍塌\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Capsule breach in five...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.71,0:34:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.67,0:34:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一条鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.23,0:34:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有20到25米长\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's like 20, 25 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.52,0:34:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's a megalodon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.84,0:34:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.52,0:34:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴我没有疯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So glad I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.52,0:34:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  关掉动力\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, power down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.96,0:34:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它有趋光性\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's drawn to the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.48,0:34:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关掉所有系统  不要开灯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shut everything down and stay dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.84,0:34:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,30秒后系统关闭\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shutdown in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.76,0:34:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关掉了  但是系统需要时间\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shutting off everything but comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.60,0:34:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它掉头回来了  苏茵\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's circling back. Here it comes, Suyin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.88,0:34:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,25秒后系统关闭\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shutdown in 25 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.60,0:34:53.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  没时间了  把灯关掉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, there's no time. Turn off your lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.48,0:34:55.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20秒后系统关闭\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shutdown in 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.84,0:34:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快关掉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Turn them off. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.96,0:34:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15秒后系统关闭\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shutdown in 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.28,0:35:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  我无法控制\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac, I have no control.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-快  -十  九\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Hurry. - Ten, nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.88,0:35:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八  七  六  五...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}eight, seven, six, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.76,0:35:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的机会来了  炸掉沉浮箱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now's your chance. Blow your tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.28,0:35:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我可以帮你救他们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No. I can help you save the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.12,0:35:36.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的滑翔器损坏了  你什么也做不了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your glider's damaged. There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.76,0:35:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快炸掉沉浮箱\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Blow your tanks now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.60,0:35:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.12,0:35:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,张博士  你女儿安全了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Dr. Zhang, your daughter's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.40,0:35:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下去找起源号\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm heading for the Origin now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.20,0:36:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标距离  3米\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Range to target, three meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.00,0:36:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海水排离完成\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Water extraction complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.00,0:36:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's do this, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不是最适合说"我早跟你说了"的时机\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Tell me this isn't the world's best "I told you so."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.44,0:36:52.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你大老远跑来就为了告诉我你是对的  是不是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You came all the way here just to tell me that, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.60,0:36:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.16,0:36:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.76,0:37:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来不太好啊  准备  一  二  三\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That doesn't look good. Ready? One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她过来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.92,0:37:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.68,0:37:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们还没脱离的情况下它撞击我们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If that thing hits us while we're still attached...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.88,0:37:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就都完蛋了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Then we're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.88,0:37:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.60,0:37:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很危急了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's gonna be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.36,0:37:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  上来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.24,0:37:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上去  快上去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.08,0:37:34.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来不及了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.24,0:37:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-来  -阿俊  快点\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Come on. - Toshi, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.28,0:37:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿俊  不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Toshi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.54,0:37:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}ごめんな。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.64,0:38:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回话  进化号\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come in, Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.44,0:38:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  回话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.84,0:38:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are you all okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海勒医生检测到了罗莉和华尔的生命体征\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Dr. Heller has vitals on Lori and The Wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.75,0:38:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是没有阿俊的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but we don't have Toshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.80,0:38:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿俊没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is Toshi okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.68,0:38:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  阿俊没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, is Toshi okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:33.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好了  -慢慢来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- All right. - Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.28,0:38:36.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-别动她的脖子  -小心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Don't move her neck. - Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.72,0:38:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  抓稳了  我们接手吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's good. Grab a hold. We got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.40,0:38:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没把阿俊救回来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You couldn't bring Toshi back?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.76,0:38:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-为什么  -他把舱口关上了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Why not? - He closed the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.12,0:38:59.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他救了我们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你丢下了他\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You left him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.52,0:39:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你丢下了他因为你就是这样的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You left him because that's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.40,0:39:09.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是把别人丢下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You are the guy who leaves people behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.68,0:39:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了那么深的海底  性命全抓在自己手上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You go that deep, you take your life in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.36,0:39:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你送他们下去的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It was your choice to send them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.72,0:39:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样我才不愿意继续了  马克\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This is why I don't do this anymore, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.56,0:39:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.52,0:39:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿刺伤刚好避开了肝脏\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, the puncture just missed her liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.08,0:39:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她失血很多\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.00,0:39:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过情况已经稳定了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But she's stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.52,0:39:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.88,0:39:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.20,0:40:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我错了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.28,0:40:04.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你救了罗莉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You save Lori,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.92,0:40:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们扯平了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we can call it even.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.20,0:40:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想为我之前说的话道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I just want to apologize for before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.40,0:40:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时很生气发脾气了  而你救了我的...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I was angry and I lose my temper. And you did save my...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.16,0:40:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没穿衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你已经尽了全力  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I know you did all you could. So, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.44,0:40:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.92,0:40:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.24,0:41:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道当个幸存者的感觉很不容易\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I know it's not easy being the person who survives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.68,0:41:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走了  你穿点衣服吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm gonna go now. You should put on some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.08,0:41:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我刚才正打算这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yep. That's the original plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.12,0:41:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  那就继续吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay, then. Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.36,0:41:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hi. Uh... I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.08,0:41:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.24,0:41:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗  乔纳斯和罗莉的婚姻糟透了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas and Lori were the worst married couple ever, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.76,0:41:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经离婚一年多了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Whole experiment was over in a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.48,0:41:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没问\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I didn't ask anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.52,0:41:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是袭击我们的元凶  巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This is what attacked us. A megalodon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.84,0:41:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它有多大\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How big is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.04,0:42:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,70到90英尺  折合21到27米\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Between 70 and 90 feet, 21 to 27 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.24,0:42:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨齿鲨是目前世上最大的鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The megalodon was the largest shark that ever existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.80,0:42:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它什么都不怕\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It feared nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.00,0:42:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有天敌\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It had no predators.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.20,0:42:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的颌比任何动物都要有力\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Its jaws were stronger than any other animal, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.16,0:42:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨齿鲨能够拦腰咬穿一头白鲸的骨头\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The meg could bite a whale in half, crushing through the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.84,0:42:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这是一片无人海域\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We are in uncharted territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.76,0:42:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在今天之前\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Until today,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.68,0:42:23.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fn方正黑体_GBK\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}牙长7.48英尺
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.96,0:42:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们都以为巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}megalodons were thought to
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.61,0:42:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在两百万年前已经绝迹了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}have been extinct for over two million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.56,0:42:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-错  -一头活化石\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Wrong. - A living fossil.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.60,0:42:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那头活化石吃掉了我的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That living fossil ate my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.12,0:42:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对骏的死也非常难过\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I cannot begin to express my sadness for Toshi's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.88,0:42:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一生难遇的大发现\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We have the discovery of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.84,0:42:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是骏一直以来努力的目标\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This is what Toshi worked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.28,0:42:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们所奋斗的目标\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's what we've all worked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.16,0:42:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们必须得慢慢来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But we're going to have to proceed slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.24,0:42:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我可能没法接受慢慢来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, that's really not gonna work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.00,0:42:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神力一号是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What is Mana One?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.04,0:43:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科研站\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This station?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.28,0:43:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  它在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yes. And what's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.08,0:43:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我指现在\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hmm? Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.24,0:43:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.64,0:43:10.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没做\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.32,0:43:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两千万的搜查者  没了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}$20 million rover, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.91,0:43:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三千万的潜水艇  没了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}$30 million sub, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.20,0:43:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们现在正坐在人类历史上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You are now sitting in the most expensive
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.36,0:43:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最昂贵的海洋生物\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}underwater marine biology day camp
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.92,0:43:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水下夏令营中\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}in human history.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.44,0:43:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疯子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.12,0:43:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在真的找到了了不起的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And now that we've actually found something amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.80,0:43:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能慢慢来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we can't proceed slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.00,0:43:32.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你信守承诺\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you for keeping your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.96,0:43:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.08,0:43:35.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能因为失去了一名宇航员\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You don't quit trying to get to the Moon
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.36,0:43:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而放弃登月\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}because you lose an astronaut.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.56,0:43:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得继续前行\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You charge forward
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.76,0:43:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然别人就会捷足先登\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}or someone else will get there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.24,0:43:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你们乐不乐意  都会有人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Other people will want a piece of this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.68,0:43:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要掺一脚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}whether we like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.60,0:43:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像很乐意\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You seem to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.68,0:43:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-什么  -我说你好像很乐意\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Excuse me? - I said, you seem to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.52,0:43:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  他也是团队的一员吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm sorry. Is he part of this team?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.04,0:43:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  他就是团队的一员\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're damn right he's a part of this team.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.28,0:44:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有没有想过大自然母亲可能很清楚自己在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You ever think that Mother Nature might know what she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.32,0:44:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,温跃层的存在可能是有理由的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The thermocline might just be there for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.24,0:44:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  你要是想探索  那就探索吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, look, you wanna explore? Go ahead, explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.96,0:44:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你继续往那下面派人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But if you start sending people back down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.04,0:44:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再让我来擦屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}don't call me to come save your asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.72,0:44:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你还不清楚下面到底发生了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Because in case what happened down there wasn't clear to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.28,0:44:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类对上巨齿鲨碰到的不是恶战\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}man vs. Meg isn't a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.12,0:44:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是屠杀\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's a slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.12,0:44:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,O层到了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}O-Level.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.00,0:45:27.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们所发现的事比我们想象中\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What you people discovered is an even bigger goldmine
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.80,0:45:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更大的金矿\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}than we ever thought possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.84,0:45:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们根本没有准备好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We are completely unprepared
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.53,0:45:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应对巨齿鲨这样的生物\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}to deal with creatures like megalodon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.96,0:45:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白  我们可以做好准备\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I understand, and we can get prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.48,0:45:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说的是长远的计划\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm talking about a long-term plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.92,0:46:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那完全是另一种选择\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's gonna be the other alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.08,0:46:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.76,0:46:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我女儿\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.40,0:46:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.60,0:46:53.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你看到梅英了吗  -我们找不到梅英\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Did you see Meiying? - We can't find Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.84,0:46:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅英  梅英\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Meiying? Meiying?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.88,0:46:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我去这边  -我们去这边\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I'll take this way. - Let's try this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.96,0:47:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅英\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.64,0:47:07.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅英\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Meiying?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.52,0:47:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-梅英  -妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Meiying. - Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.70,0:47:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2}孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.68,0:47:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.88,0:47:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个怪兽  在看着我们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There's a monster and it's watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.44,0:47:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  只是一条鲸鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's okay. It's just a whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.72,0:47:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  露西呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wait. Where's Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.64,0:47:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母鲸呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Where's the mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.80,0:48:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-科研站没事吧  -汇报\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Is the station all right? - Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.68,0:48:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有漏水  没有肉眼可见的损伤\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No leaks. No visible damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.44,0:48:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  小队启动紧急应对程序\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}All right, team. Initiate emergency protocols.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.64,0:48:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-所有人都不得接近水边  -如果你坚持的话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- And nobody is to go near the water. - If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.44,0:48:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关掉所有水下照明\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Turn off all the underwater lighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.56,0:48:14.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让所有船员只在必要区域内活动\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Restrict the crew to essential areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.64,0:48:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说它不可能找到这里来的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You said it was impossible for it to get up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.28,0:48:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It should have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.88,0:48:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们  来看看这个\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You guys, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.68,0:48:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滑翔器起飞时  隔温层是完整的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}When the glider came up, the thermocline was intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.08,0:48:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-所以应该是一摄氏度  对吗  -没错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- so it was one degree Celsius, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.12,0:48:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是一分钟后  进化号上去后\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But a minute later, when the Evolution came up,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.88,0:48:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题升高了25度\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}the temperature increased by 25 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.00,0:48:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲨鱼可以通过这里出来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}A shark could come right through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.20,0:48:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能通过20条\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Twenty sharks for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.96,0:48:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨齿鲨撞上起源号后  撞坏了散热阀\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}When the meg hit the Origin, it slammed into a thermal vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.88,0:48:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每分钟能漏上百万加仑油\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Those can release millions of gallons per minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.80,0:48:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阀门的热量\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The heat from that vent
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.97,0:48:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在冷冻层中清出了一条路\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}cleared the path through the freezing cold layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.56,0:48:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我们给巨鲨鱼开了一条高速通道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are you saying we opened up a superhighway for giant sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.96,0:48:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不完全是  好像只有很短暂的时间\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Not exactly. It seems like it was a transitory event.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.80,0:48:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后温度就恢复正常  缺口也封上了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The temperatures are returned to normal and the gap is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.92,0:48:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  但是有一只巨大的史前杀戮机器\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah. But not before a massive prehistoric killing machine
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.88,0:48:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经决定跑出来打个招呼了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}decided to come up and say "Hi."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.08,0:49:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我们这是在浪费时间  外面没有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, look, we're wasting time. That thing's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.36,0:49:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得找到它  杀了它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We need to find it and kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.16,0:49:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.32,0:49:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  我们得先寻找不需要杀戮的办法\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We can't. We should explore non-lethal options first.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.16,0:49:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于巨齿鲨来说还是对于我们来说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}For the meg or for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.12,0:49:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.20,0:49:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现一束紧急求救定位光束\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I've got an emergency locator beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.24,0:49:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-南西南方向20英里  -什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Twenty miles south-southwest. - What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.92,0:49:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说明有一艘船翻了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It means a boat has gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.72,0:49:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-注意  -三艘船\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Attention. - Three boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.52,0:49:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那头巨齿鲨  我们得赶紧过去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's the meg. We need to get there. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.96,0:49:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  我又发现\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac! I found something!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.28,0:50:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些鲨鱼没有鳍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}These sharks have no fins.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.16,0:50:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们都是被鲨鱼偷猎者杀的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They were killed by shark poachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.72,0:50:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们割掉鲨鱼的鳍  然后把它们扔回海里等死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They cut off the fins and throw the shark back to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.52,0:50:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就为了一碗汤\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}All for a bowl of soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.56,0:50:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来巨齿鲨扳平了比分\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Looks like the meg evened the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.36,0:50:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都是一条鱼干的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}One fish did all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.92,0:50:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己问她吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ask her yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.32,0:50:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.56,0:50:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的甲板上有防鲨笼和矛枪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We have a shark cage and spearguns on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.44,0:50:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你能射中巨齿鲨的嘴巴或者鳃等柔软的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If we can shoot the meg in a soft spot like its mouth or gills,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.96,0:50:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能注射一些致命的毒物\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}we can inject it with something lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.02,0:50:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安装防鲨笼得要20分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's gonna take at least 20 minutes to rig the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.12,0:50:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙两分钟就能跑没影了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And that thing will be gone in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.56,0:50:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不在它身上装个跟踪器呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Why don't you just put a tracker on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.80,0:50:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没看过《鲨鱼周》吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Don't you guys ever watch Shark Week?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.64,0:50:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以搞点定位的小玩意\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You have one of those, like, GPS tracker tag thingamajigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.40,0:50:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盯住那条鲨鱼  等笼子安装好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Keep an eye on the shark till the cage is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.96,0:50:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该能往背鳍上发射跟踪镖\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We should be able to put a tracking dart in that dorsal fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.08,0:50:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.36,0:51:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  但我们得把这艘船开到巨齿鲨边上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, but somehow we have to get this boat next to that meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.68,0:51:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.32,0:51:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很明显对船只很有攻击性\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's already proven aggressive towards boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.56,0:51:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最安全的捷径办法就是不靠任何交通工具\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The safest way to approach is without a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.68,0:51:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-等等  等等  -你想找人游过去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Hold up. Hold up. - You want someone to swim out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.16,0:51:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找一条吃掉我们朋友的史前巨鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}To a prehistoric shark that ate our friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.16,0:51:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  我们一个人下水不会构成威胁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Actually, one of us alone in the water is no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.20,0:51:17.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那谁游过去呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay, who the hell is gonna make that swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.48,0:51:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来抽签吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's draw straws.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.00,0:51:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会游泳\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.52,0:51:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我的本能\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sorry, my body made me say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.92,0:51:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.40,0:51:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怎么确定\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.32,0:51:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我被吃了  你肯定会很难过\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If I get eaten, you're gonna feel really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.84,0:51:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根追踪枪只有100英尺的射程\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This tracker rifle only has a 100-foot range.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.52,0:51:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百英尺\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hundred feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.80,0:51:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要靠近了再发射\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Get really close before you shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.72,0:51:55.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.40,0:51:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想让我去也可以的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If you want me to go instead, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.52,0:52:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以的  马克\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I got this, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.08,0:52:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  因为我骗你的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay, good, 'cause I was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.56,0:52:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-保重  -谢了  伙计\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Be safe. - Yeah, thanks, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.20,0:52:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你说的没错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I hope you're right about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.80,0:52:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.00,0:52:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是个笨蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.68,0:52:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在接近一头巨大的杀人鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I am proceeding to the enormous killer shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.28,0:52:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能接收到  乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, we got you, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.36,0:52:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲨鱼会被慌张的动作所吸引\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sharks are attracted to panic motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.88,0:52:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持动作稳定\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Keep it nice and smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:52:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's all gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.52,0:53:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续游\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just keep swimming
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.84,0:53:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续游\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just keep swimming
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.20,0:53:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游  游\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Swimming, swimming
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.80,0:53:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续游\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just keep swimming
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.40,0:53:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  它往水下沉了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, boy, it's going under.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.56,0:54:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他成功了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.24,0:54:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  追踪器有反应了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac, tracker is live!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.56,0:54:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  把他拉上来  DJ\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Great! Reel him in, DJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.60,0:54:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停  停  不要有震动\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Stop! Stop! No vibration!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.08,0:54:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了  我有麻烦了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, shit. I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.68,0:54:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  它冲你来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, it's coming at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.00,0:54:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我没有注意到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You think I didn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.32,0:54:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发动船  发动船\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Start the boat! Start the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.20,0:54:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他拉上来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Pull him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.28,0:55:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-拜托  拜托  -拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Come on! Come on! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.84,0:55:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能的确是个混蛋  但你绝对不是懦夫\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You might be a son of a bitch, but you're sure as hell no coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.28,0:55:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.96,0:55:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我准备了注射埃托啡的标枪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I prepared the spearheads to inject etorphine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.88,0:56:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只需要10毫升就能放倒一头食人鲸\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}A killer whale is knocked out with 10 cc's.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.56,0:56:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20毫升就能致死  怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Dead with 20. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.36,0:56:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们得用上一整瓶\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think we use the whole damn bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.60,0:56:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再和我说说为什么这算是个好主意\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Remind me again why this is a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.60,0:56:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  这是个防鲨笼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What? It's a shark cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.08,0:56:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塑料防鲨笼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Plastic shark cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.04,0:56:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就当没听见你说的这话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm gonna ignore that you just said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.96,0:56:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个宝贝是聚碳酸酯制的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This beautiful thing is polycarbonate,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.92,0:56:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专门设计不会开裂  不会碎裂  只会变形\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}specifically designed not to crack, not to break, but to deform.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.96,0:56:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这种厚度的笼子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And in this case, at this thickness,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.12,0:56:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能承受住每平方英尺两万磅的冲击力\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}it would take 20,000 pounds per square inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.96,0:56:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果要打破的话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And if you're talking about breaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.12,0:56:35.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得需要八九十万磅\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that's eight to nine hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.16,0:56:40.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.56,0:56:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Doesn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.16,0:56:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定不会进去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I wouldn't get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.92,0:56:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续放\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Keep it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.04,0:56:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.44,0:57:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.92,0:57:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说"小心点"  这是他的"我爱你"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He said, "Be careful." That's his version of "I love you."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.96,0:57:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲对你很有信心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your father has a lot of faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.20,0:57:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做过几百次下潜捕鲨了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I've done hundreds of shark dives.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.68,0:57:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有像这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.20,0:57:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  但我了解鲨鱼的生理结构\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yes. But I know shark anatomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.00,0:57:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道能用这个戳破巨齿鲨的哪个部位\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And I know where this can penetrate through the megalodon's skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.00,0:57:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  让我去...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, let me go instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.76,0:57:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心我  让我去做我最擅长的事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Don't worry about me. Let me do what I do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.08,0:58:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都没有问题吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Everything okay up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.72,0:58:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又放了一轮鱼饵下去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just a fresh round of chum,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.04,0:58:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你尝起来肯定很美味\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}so you, you know, taste good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.20,0:58:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么关心我真是太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm so glad you're looking out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.48,0:58:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  再见  祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you. Bye-bye. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.64,0:59:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面怎么样了  你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What's happening down there? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.52,0:59:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事  只是一些八英尺长的小鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah. I'm okay. Just some teeny, tiny eight-foot sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.64,0:59:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.16,0:59:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成功吸引到了她\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We've got her attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.32,0:59:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  它来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, it's on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.44,0:59:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-五十米  -五十米\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Fifty meters. - Fifty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.72,0:59:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三十\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.96,0:59:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十米\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ten meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.12,0:59:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.16,1:00:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要试试射它的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm going to try to hit it in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.84,1:00:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.24,1:00:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Whoa! Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.44,1:00:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.84,1:00:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  毒素已注射\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yes! The poison is in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.84,1:00:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  坚持住\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay, Suyin, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.28,1:00:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被困住了  我在它的嘴里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm trapped! I'm in its mouth!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.20,1:00:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个笼子是不可能破的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That cage will not break.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.40,1:00:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在  笼子要被吞下去了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's the problem. The cage is being swallowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.00,1:01:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不是又来吧  该死  该死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Not this again. - Oh, man. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.84,1:01:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有问题了  我的面具破了  我在市区氧气\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}New problem. My mask is broken. I'm losing air.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.08,1:02:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.96,1:02:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.36,1:02:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  杰克斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, Jaxx!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.88,1:02:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-谢谢你  -不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.48,1:02:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  乔纳斯  回船上去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No, Jonas. Go! Get back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.92,1:02:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里不安全\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's not safe for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.32,1:02:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  回去  乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, go back. Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.84,1:02:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  架子掉下去了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, the crane's in the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.16,1:02:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会被拉入海底的  快点\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's gonna pull her to the bottom. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.44,1:02:59.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把备用吊车转过来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Swing the second crane over.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.96,1:03:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要设个陷阱  伙计们  我需要点诱饵\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We're gonna set a trap. Guys, I need some bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.60,1:03:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  抓住它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on. Got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.96,1:04:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.32,1:04:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边  扔条绳子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This way. Throw a rope.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.16,1:04:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没有呼吸了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She's not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.92,1:05:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢点  你刚刚还没气着呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Take it easy. You were dead a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.48,1:05:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.04,1:05:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我救了出来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You got me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.56,1:05:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千钧一发\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It was closer than I would've liked.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.80,1:05:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能和乔纳斯谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Can I have a minute with Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.00,1:05:32.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.28,1:05:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又一次救了我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You saved me. Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.36,1:05:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我更喜欢你活着\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I prefer you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.08,1:05:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能想要看点东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There's something you might wanna see.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.24,1:06:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看谁醒了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey! Look who's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.80,1:06:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你怎么样  -好多了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- How are ya? - I'm better. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.92,1:06:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  拍一张我和这头臭怪兽的照片\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, get a picture of me with this big smelly beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.32,1:06:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  等等  这样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay. Wait. Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.20,1:06:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要拍张好的就把头放进去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, you want a proper picture, get your head inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.00,1:06:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-近点  -还要近点\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Closer. - Closer?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.32,1:06:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  进去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.40,1:06:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.44,1:06:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.64,1:06:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  拜托告诉我你都拍下来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yo, Jonas, please tell me you got that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.00,1:06:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拍下来了  GJ\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I got that, DJ.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.96,1:06:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一点都不好笑  伙计\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's not funny, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.12,1:06:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  说真的  很好笑  你看\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No, like seriously, it's funny. Look. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.40,1:06:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,*我们把肉盾推到水里*\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}*We got The Wall in the water*
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.96,1:06:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,*我们把肉盾推到水里*\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}*We got The Wall in the water*
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.64,1:06:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,*我们把肉盾推到水里*\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}*We got The Wall in the water*
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.96,1:06:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, Suyin.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.72,1:07:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看他在巨齿鲨边上的照片\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look at him next to the meg.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.92,1:07:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得O层的咬痕吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look, remember the bite marks on the O-Level?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.72,1:07:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, how do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.52,1:07:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是人类与大自然激战的时刻\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That was a serious man vs. Nature moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.44,1:07:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好最后我们赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm just glad things went our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.64,1:07:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有赢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It didn't go our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.56,1:07:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对阿俊来说没有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Not for Toshi.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.44,1:07:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对科学来说也没有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And not for science.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.76,1:07:28.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做了人类经常做的事  发现  然后毁灭\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We did what people always do. Discover and then destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.88,1:07:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要弄死你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, I will end you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.52,1:07:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少你可以用这张来做你的约会软件头像\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}At least you can use this as your dating app pic.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.08,1:07:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-给你一脚  -没错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Give you a little leg, you know. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.88,1:07:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像水母一样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, yeah! Jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.52,1:08:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两条  有两条\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Two! There's two?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.76,1:08:27.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人告诉我有两条\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nobody said there were two.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.40,1:08:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会有两条\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How are there two?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.32,1:08:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命  把我救上去  救命啊  救命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Help me! Get me out of this water! Help! Somebody help, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.20,1:08:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.64,1:08:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.88,1:08:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会游泳\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.32,1:08:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  赶紧上来  认真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No! Get outta here! Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.32,1:08:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟我来种族歧视这套\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Don't pull that racist stuff on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.80,1:08:45.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  饶了我吧  我没有种族歧视\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, man. Give me a break. I'm not being racist.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.84,1:08:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可是在海洋中央工作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You work, literally, in the middle of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.16,1:08:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作要求中没有这条\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This wasn't part of the job description.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.08,1:08:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都不是工作要求\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}None of this was part of the job description!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.32,1:08:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没写这一条\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They left that part out!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.19,1:08:58.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}爸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.94,1:09:01.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}爸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.48,1:09:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该找人来帮忙了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's time to get some real help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.80,1:09:10.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  找人来帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah. Go get some help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.04,1:09:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要辞职\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm quitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.20,1:09:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  帮我一把\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac! Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.80,1:09:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你找到我的地点\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, I need you to find my location.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.92,1:09:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追踪我的卫星电话  还有一条鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Track my sat phone. There's a second shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.32,1:09:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  两条  我怎么知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yes, two. How the hell should I know?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.52,1:09:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧找人来帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just hurry up and get us some help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.60,1:09:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-谢谢你  乔纳斯  谢谢  -有什么带什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Thank you, Jonas. Thank you. - Bring whatever you got!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.96,1:09:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松  放松  不大妙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just relax. Relax. It's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.84,1:09:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要赶紧送他去医院\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He needs a hospital fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.68,1:09:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得找医生  海勒医生呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's get the doctor. Where's Dr. Heller?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.44,1:09:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jaxx?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.48,1:09:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克斯  你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jaxx, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.44,1:09:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还行吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah! Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.20,1:09:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克斯  我们可以的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jaxx. We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.44,1:09:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢地游到船上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Swim gently back to the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.84,1:10:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢地\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.88,1:10:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.44,1:10:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海勒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Heller!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.28,1:10:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不行了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.56,1:10:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克斯  你不会有事的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jaxx. You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.24,1:10:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个很好的人  杰克斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're a good person, Jaxx.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.80,1:10:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.96,1:10:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要回头\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.32,1:10:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.92,1:10:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海勒  你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Heller, no! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.40,1:10:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.92,1:10:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hey! Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.52,1:10:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海勒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Heller!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.04,1:10:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.76,1:10:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-来  -抓到你了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Come on. - We got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.84,1:10:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  杰克斯  你会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's okay, Jaxx. You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.68,1:11:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  海勒  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you, Heller, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.44,1:11:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么  那到底是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What was that? What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.96,1:11:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好了  拜托  DJ  -不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Okay, come on, DJ. - No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.96,1:11:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们不能离开科研站  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This is why we don't leave the station, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.60,1:11:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们不能这样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's why you don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.88,1:11:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们下去  把它惹毛了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And you went down there and you pissed it off,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.24,1:11:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在它要回来把我们都杀了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}now it's gonna come back and kill every one of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.08,1:11:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们要怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.60,1:11:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一开始就不该出来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I shouldn't even be out here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.16,1:11:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要在这里游泳  这个吃了那个\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Swimming in this ocean. That one ate the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.16,1:11:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个还要吃这个吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is another one gonna eat this one?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.88,1:11:30.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计  这\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Man, it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.20,1:11:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它刚刚杀了海勒\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It just killed Heller.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.28,1:11:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它杀了肉盾  它杀了阿俊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It killed The Wall. It killed Toshi.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.72,1:11:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是我的朋友啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}These are my friends, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.80,1:11:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能说一句吗  这东西正在下沉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay, can I just point out that this thing is sinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.36,1:11:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What are we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.64,1:11:56.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Where's Mac?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.80,1:12:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.52,1:12:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你的头发怎么了  -你的头发怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- What happened to your hair? - What happened to your hair?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.76,1:12:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Touché.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.56,1:12:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.64,1:12:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意简直是个恶魔\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That thing is the devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.16,1:12:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟了我们十英里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ten miles, it's still with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.24,1:12:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You got us?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.04,1:12:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大洋  我们在大洋正中央\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The ocean. The middle of a freaking ocean!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.28,1:12:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得如果我们把他扔下去能拖住它吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Do you think it'd slow down the shark if we threw him over?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.00,1:12:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得自己动手\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You gotta work on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.76,1:12:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好消息  伙计们  复仇的时候到了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay. Good news, guys. It's payback time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.88,1:13:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.12,1:13:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尝尝厉害吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yes! Get some!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.68,1:13:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的觉得子弹能伤到那玩意吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You seriously think that a rifle is gonna hurt that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.44,1:13:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一时间也说不了太多\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I didn't have much notice,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.97,1:13:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想要甩掉它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}okay? I just wanted to get it off our backs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.40,1:13:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好样的  莫里斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well done, Morris.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.65,1:13:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}爸爸对不起你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.28,1:13:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}你说什么呢  爸
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.37,1:13:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}爸爸对你严厉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.74,1:14:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}对你要求这么高
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.58,1:14:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}是因为爸爸知道你的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.50,1:14:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}我一直想成为你  想像你一样优秀
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.50,1:14:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}但是我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.21,1:14:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}我还是没有做到
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.84,1:14:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}爸爸心里你是最勇敢的女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.14,1:14:24.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}你是爸爸这辈子最大的骄傲
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.19,1:14:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}爸爸做梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.98,1:14:29.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}都想着梅英
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.15,1:14:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}长大了能像你一样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.11,1:14:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}别说话了  爸
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.44,1:14:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}我懂
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.96,1:15:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.08,1:15:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mummy! Mummy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.68,1:15:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来  妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Welcome back, Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.84,1:16:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.56,1:16:38.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅英怎么样了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How's Meiying?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.92,1:16:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很难过\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She's sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.84,1:16:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也很困惑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.72,1:16:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么样了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.88,1:16:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不想接受\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I really don't want to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.48,1:16:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的时候发生的一些事能改变你的一生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sometimes things happen that change your life forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.12,1:17:02.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而世界还是照常运转\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Meanwhile, the world just keeps going.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.92,1:17:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为也许一切能稍微停下来一会\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You think maybe it would stop just for a second,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.68,1:17:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而并不会\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.52,1:17:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么接受的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How do you live with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.84,1:17:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.00,1:17:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我丢下了我的两个最好的朋友去死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I left my two best friends to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.68,1:17:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每时每刻都萦绕在我脑子里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think about it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.64,1:17:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都会在我脑子里重现\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Every day I replay it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.64,1:17:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能做到更多吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Could I have done more?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.44,1:17:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不仅仅要看你失去的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's not just about the ones you lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.32,1:17:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要看你所拯救的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's also about the ones you save.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.44,1:17:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴有你在\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.52,1:18:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经通知了中国政府关于巨齿鲨的事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I've informed the Chinese government about the meg.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.44,1:18:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还通知了泰国  越南  印度尼西亚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}As well as the authorities in Thailand,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.30,1:18:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及印度的政府\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Vietnam, Indonesia, and Australia.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.88,1:18:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国方面要派两艘驱逐舰消灭它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The Chinese are sending two destroyers to take it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.12,1:18:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以现在这件事正式不归我们管了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So, this is now officially and thankfully out of our hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.92,1:18:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在巨齿鲨被杀死之前\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm closing Mana One
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.40,1:18:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要关闭神力一号\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}until the meg is killed
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.16,1:18:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明早会派疏散船只来接我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and an evacuation ship is coming here tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.44,1:18:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才对\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You damn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.84,1:18:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后  我想说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And finally, I just want to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.16,1:18:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm sorry for your losses.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.84,1:18:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的朋友们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.60,1:18:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来是来和你们一起庆祝的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I came here to celebrate with you
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.60,1:18:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我和你们一起哀悼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and now I'm mourning with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.56,1:19:07.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我们擦屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thanks for saving our asses!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.64,1:19:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我带了什么好东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What do you got for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.88,1:19:21.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是塞姆汀高速爆破弹\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}These are Semtex high-velocity demolition charges.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.96,1:19:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让那些人改装了引线  能够有足够的时间沉没\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I had the men rig delay fuses to give them time to sink.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.92,1:19:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些就是深水炸弹\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Essentially, they're depth charges.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.28,1:19:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才对\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.04,1:19:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不建议我们这样做\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm not sure this is a advisable course of action.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.32,1:19:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被那玩意弄死或弄惨的每个人都是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Every person that gets maimed or killed by that thing
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.49,1:19:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜在的诉讼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}is a potential lawsuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.04,1:19:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜在的损失\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}A potential casualty.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.88,1:19:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松  伙计  会很有意思的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Relax, bro. It's gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.48,1:19:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我能看到你的牌  -看看你们俩\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I can see your cards. - Well, look at you two crooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.76,1:19:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你感觉怎么放\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.72,1:19:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你的其它人比起来  我还算好的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Like I got off easy, compared to the rest of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.64,1:20:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么牌\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What do you got up there?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.32,1:20:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三张K\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Three kings.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.48,1:20:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  拜托  每次都这样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What? Come on. Every time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.64,1:20:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你欠我一瓶苏打水  -好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You owe me a soda for that one. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.76,1:20:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你回来后我们再比  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We'll square up when you get back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.52,1:20:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧好吧好吧好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Fine. Fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.68,1:20:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想转移一下她的注意力\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just trying to take her mind off things, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.56,1:20:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她肯定比你要坚强\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She's tougher than me, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.60,1:20:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉我之前没有相信你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm sorry I didn't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.84,1:20:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你至少没叫我疯子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, you didn't call me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.16,1:20:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  但我也没说你是正常的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, but I didn't call you sane.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.24,1:20:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不常听到别人说我"正常"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, well, "Sane" Wasn't a word I heard very often.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.36,1:20:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.08,1:20:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  可能回泰国吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know. Go back to Thailand, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.76,1:20:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克和我说了你和苏茵的事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac told me about you and Suyin.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.92,1:20:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-没什么好说的  -也许可以有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Nothing to tell. - Well, maybe there could be.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.72,1:20:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和马克太令人难以置信了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You and Mac are unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.12,1:20:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不如做点新的尝试\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How about you just try something new?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.28,1:20:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你的余生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So the rest of your life
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.78,1:20:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不会再孤独和悲惨中度过了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}isn't a vast wasteland of misery and solitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.92,1:20:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那是个好主意\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.36,1:20:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.92,1:20:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八岁小孩无所不知\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Eight-year-olds hear everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.56,1:21:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.52,1:21:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈也喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My mom likes you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.44,1:21:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该是我这辈子最可怕的时刻\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This is possibly the worst moment of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.28,1:21:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接近目标区域\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Approaching target area.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.96,1:21:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来进行确认\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'll confirm visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.88,1:21:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先说清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let me make myself absolutely clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.08,1:21:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在直升机杀死那头怪兽之前\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We are not getting within a mile of that monster
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.60,1:21:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝对不能接近它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}until the helicopter kills it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.56,1:21:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现了目标\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We have a visual on the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.56,1:21:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停船\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Stop the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.28,1:21:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部署深水炸弹\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Deploying depth charges.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.04,1:21:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炸到它了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.12,1:21:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再炸\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hit it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.32,1:22:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-先生  它不可能  -再炸\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Sir, there's no way possible... - Hit it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.40,1:22:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标已死亡  重复  目标已死亡\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Target is dead. Repeat, target is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.52,1:22:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你百分百确定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are you absolutely sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.96,1:22:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我可不要被什么史前的鱼吃掉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Because I'm not getting eaten by some goddamn prehistoric fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.12,1:22:17.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认  先生  它...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Affirmative, sir. There's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.56,1:22:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它被炸得粉碎了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, there's pieces of it all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.28,1:22:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲨鱼块\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shark chunks?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.44,1:22:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个好迹象\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.04,1:22:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  带我们过去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}All right. Take us in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.00,1:22:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳下去  给我拔几根牙齿\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jump down there, get me a couple of teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.84,1:22:38.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要几根大的  放我书桌上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Big ones for my desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.12,1:22:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好  -你自己也留一根\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- All right. - Keep one for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.88,1:22:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.60,1:22:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.40,1:22:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.72,1:22:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太变态了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.16,1:23:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.92,1:23:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  别这么对我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, man! Don't do that to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.64,1:23:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意没有尖牙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That thing doesn't have any teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.40,1:23:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.92,1:23:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们杀死了一条鲸鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think we killed a whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.96,1:23:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就在我们下面\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's right below us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.28,1:23:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧带我们离开\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Get us outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.76,1:23:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  你们这些笨蛋  等等\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wait! Wait, you idiots! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.12,1:23:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里  等等\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm over here! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.52,1:23:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.88,1:24:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白  我明白  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, I understand. I understand, yep. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.48,1:24:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来猜猜  莫里斯没给任何人打电话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let me guess, Morris never called anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.60,1:24:21.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没给任何人打过\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Didn't call anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.96,1:24:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人知道这里有鲨鱼  没人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No one knows the shark's out there. No one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.44,1:24:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么澳大利亚  中国  都不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Not the Australians, not the Chinese. No one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.72,1:24:28.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The hell was he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.24,1:24:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想让大事化小  小事化无\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He wanted to make this go away as quietly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.68,1:24:31.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克  我们得告诉...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac, we need to let everyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.76,1:24:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我所有人  嗯  我在着手处理了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let everyone know. Yeah, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.00,1:24:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克斯  你能找到那玩意吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jaxx, can you find that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.68,1:24:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  你为什么要这样问她\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wait, wait, wait. Why're you asking her that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.12,1:24:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你要问她的这个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't like the fact that you asking her about that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.72,1:24:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你希望我违法黑入\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You want me to illegally
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.79,1:24:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫里斯的卫星追踪系统\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}hack into Morris' satellite tracking system
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.88,1:24:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-找到一条史前鲨鱼  -没错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- to find a prehistoric shark? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.12,1:24:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.48,1:24:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们用追踪器  找到巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We use a tracker, find the meg,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.52,1:24:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-再把它杀了  -兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- and we kill it. - Bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.16,1:24:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们真的要这么做吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We really gonna do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.60,1:24:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然很多人都会死  马克\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}A lot of people are gonna die if we don't, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.88,1:24:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-算我一个  -我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Well, I'm in. - Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.12,1:24:58.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.20,1:25:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我们用疏散船怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How do you feel about commandeering that evac ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.44,1:25:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'd say, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.88,1:25:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是钓鱼的好日子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}it's a great day to go fishing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.68,1:25:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把所有东西都搬上去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now let's get everything on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.96,1:25:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炸药  滑翔器  全部所有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Construction explosives, gliders. The whole lot. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.36,1:25:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们要疏散了  对吗  疏散的船\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Because we're about to evac, right? Like evacuate?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.48,1:25:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像正常人一样离开这个无比危险的区域\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Like, leave the area of imminent danger
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.68,1:25:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取一个安全的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and go to a safe place like normal people?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.32,1:25:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样  杰克斯  有发现吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What we got, Jaxx? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.76,1:25:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看到莫里斯在这里标记了鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah. Here's where we saw Morris tag the shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.40,1:25:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它正在前往这里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But here is where it's going.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.52,1:25:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-三亚湾  那是什么  -没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Sanya Bay. What's there? - Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.40,1:25:41.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里只有全世界\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It only has some of the
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.52,1:25:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人数最多的海滩\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}most densely populated beaches in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.76,1:25:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能联系上政府吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Any luck with the authorities?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.56,1:25:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能  "史前鲨鱼"听上去就像恶作剧电话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No. "Prehistoric shark" Sounds like a damn prank call.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.48,1:25:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没法靠他们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We can't rely on them for anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.48,1:25:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲨鱼还有多久会抵达有人的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How long until the shark gets to those people?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.16,1:25:54.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Twenty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.28,1:25:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们能抢先一步感到吗  -深表怀疑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Can we get there first? - Doubtful.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.40,1:25:57.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须得去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, we're gonna have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.48,1:26:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们没有计划  先到也没有意义\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Getting there first won't mean anything if we don't have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.44,1:26:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们有计划\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe we have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.28,1:26:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在这个浅滩行动\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Here's where we do it. Right here in the shallows.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.80,1:26:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用滑翔器追踪它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Use the gliders and go after it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.56,1:26:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边明明有一大堆能吃的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay, so, how are we gonna get it here
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.72,1:26:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它为什么要舍弃海滩而来这里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}when there's a beach full of people to eat right here?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.36,1:26:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你请它出来吃晚餐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You ask it out for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.84,1:26:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So, how do you wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.56,1:26:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在询问我的意见吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is that you asking my opinion?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.72,1:26:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.88,1:26:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是客气一下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I was just being polite
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.08,1:26:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后告诉你我们真正要怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}before telling you what we're actually doing,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.56,1:26:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你就能自我感觉稍微好一点\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}so you feel better about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.40,1:26:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.76,1:26:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.40,1:26:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.12,1:26:55.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们准备好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We're ready.
