Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.74,1:29:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}美女
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.95,1:29:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}过来一起玩
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.28,1:29:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}我们有位子
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.12,1:30:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够近了  停在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We're close enough. Stop here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.32,1:30:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克斯  DJ  我们得把那东西放进水里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jaxx, DJ, we gotta get that thing in the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.36,1:30:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, we're on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.56,1:31:03.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲨鱼  鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shark! Shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.69,1:31:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}所有人都上来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.77,1:31:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}快点  上来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.61,1:31:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}上来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.74,1:31:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}快点上来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.86,1:31:17.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}快上来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.55,1:31:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}它去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.01,1:31:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}有人看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.47,1:31:39.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}它不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.21,1:32:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}拉我上岸
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.30,1:32:21.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}别丢下我们
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.59,1:32:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}它走了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.76,1:32:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.56,1:33:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们的计划还有什么最后的意见吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Any last thoughts about our plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.76,1:33:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如就从"别死"开始\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Not dying would be a good start.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.76,1:33:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们终于有意见一致的了  以后还是别这样了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Finally, we agree on something. Let's not make it a habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.44,1:33:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  小心  快开走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, look out! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.12,1:33:33.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-该死  -怎么了  乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Damn it! - What's wrong, Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.60,1:33:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法开火  离船太近了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Can't make the shot. It's too close to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.36,1:33:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.84,1:33:42.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  它在你上面\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, it's on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.36,1:33:43.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马克\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mac!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.84,1:33:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  下面怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, what's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.36,1:33:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想进它的嘴巴\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Trying to stay out of its mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.24,1:34:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.28,1:34:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  你好了吗  我来找你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, are you set? I'm coming to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.76,1:34:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就位了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.88,1:34:30.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲨鱼原来越近了  我需要一点空间\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shark's getting close. I need a little breathing room.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.28,1:34:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我准备好开火了  -开火\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I'm ready to fire. - Take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.08,1:34:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开  让开\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.24,1:34:50.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}看那个是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.99,1:34:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}去那边
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.32,1:35:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人看到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Anybody see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.52,1:35:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不到鲨鱼  但是这里有点不对劲\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Can't see the shark, but something's going on up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.52,1:35:19.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吸引到它的注意了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Okay, I've got her attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.80,1:35:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它引到我这里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Bring her to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.68,1:35:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Here we come.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.20,1:35:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  苏茵\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Make your move, Suyin.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.72,1:35:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尝尝这个吧  你这个丑家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Chew on this, you ugly bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.16,1:35:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不  该死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No, no, no! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.56,1:35:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.02,1:36:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}小心
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.96,1:36:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不  走走走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No, no, no. Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.32,1:36:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-DJ在哪里  -我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Where's DJ? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.36,1:36:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-梅英在哪里  -我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Where's Meiying? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.84,1:36:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我哪里都找不到她  -乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I couldn't see her anywhere. - Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.04,1:36:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-抱歉  我  -快去  照顾好梅英\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Sorry, I... - Go, go. Take care of Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.28,1:36:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.84,1:36:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事  我再把它引出去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm okay. I'm leading it away from the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.64,1:36:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-天啊  我得  -别拍水了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Oh, my God! Gotta get... - Stop splashing!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.00,1:36:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿着救生衣呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You have a life jacket on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.48,1:36:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-救生衣  -没错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- A life jacket? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.36,1:36:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  我穿着救生衣呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Oh, yeah. I've got a life jacket on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.56,1:36:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这里呢  我能...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's right here. I can...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.08,1:37:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪物在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The monster's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.68,1:37:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪物在这里  别担心怪物  有我呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The monster's here? No, don't worry about the monster, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.40,1:37:05.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-一切都没事  -别说话了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Everything's fine. - Stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.04,1:37:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅英\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.00,1:37:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  是你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mummy! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.36,1:37:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  等等  等等  等等我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's good! Wait! Wait! Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.01,1:37:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等DJ  等等DJ\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wait for DJ, wait for DJ. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.32,1:37:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-太好了  -上来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Yes. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.92,1:37:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mummy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.72,1:37:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.28,1:37:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也没事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.72,1:37:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-上来  -上来  -先上来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Come on. Come up! - Get out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.60,1:37:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-梅英  小心  -乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Meiying, be careful. - Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.64,1:37:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  小心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Careful. Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.88,1:37:40.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-它在那里  -天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- There it is. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.76,1:37:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.64,1:37:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-它要来了  -我们现在完全无法反抗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- It's coming. - We're sitting ducks up here, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.00,1:37:46.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-妈妈  -它要来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Mummy! - It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.20,1:37:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你能听到吗  乔纳斯  -梅英  坚持住\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Can you hear me, Jonas? - Meiying, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.56,1:37:50.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  我们要走了  这边\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, we're gonna have to go. Through here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.40,1:37:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔纳斯  我们什么都没了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jonas, we've got nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.72,1:37:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几乎什么都没了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Almost nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.36,1:37:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎么杀死它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How're you gonna kill it?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.00,1:37:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化号\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.20,1:37:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让它流血\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm gonna make this thing bleed.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.68,1:38:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏茵  你之前说的话没错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Suyin, what you said before, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.04,1:38:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能看着你失去的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's not about the people you lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.00,1:38:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是要看你拯救的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's about the people you save.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.80,1:38:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-下线  -乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Signing off. - Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.36,1:38:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.56,1:38:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吗  流血\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How do you like that? Bleed!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.76,1:38:35.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fn方正黑体_GBK\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}系统崩溃
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.56,1:38:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  拜托  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.24,1:38:50.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.51,1:40:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}我们的婚礼没了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.43,1:40:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(192,219.733)\bord1\shad1\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\fs18\b1\c&HD1DDE3&}你杀了皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.56,1:40:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.60,1:41:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.76,1:41:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让一让  疯子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Beep-beep! Coming through, Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.88,1:41:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你好啊  -看看谁来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Hi. - Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.80,1:41:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬活着\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, here's to being alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.40,1:41:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬我们的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And to our friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.48,1:41:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.92,1:41:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎想的  但我需要好好放个假\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know about you, but, uh, I could use a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.52,1:41:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要问问我妈妈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shall we ask my mum?

